                      "task": "STAGE_ONE на well branch 0, TEMPLATE_ONE @ MD=500.",
                      "schedule_text": "FRACTURE_SPECS\n'STAGE_ONE' 'well' 0 /\n'TEMPLATE_ONE' 500 /\n/\n",
                      "explanation": "Контент §12.2.131 (FRACTURE_WELL в новых мануалах). Variant point. WELLTRACK уже в GRID."
